  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「やっほ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「勝手に入っちゃってごめんね、あんずさんに聞いたら部屋で寝てるっていうからさ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「んもう、いくら夏休みだからってだらけすぎだよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「もうお昼だよ、起きて起きて。昼夜逆転しちゃってるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「仕方ないなぁ、優しい幼なじみのなつみちゃんが君のたるんだ生活習慣を正してあげようっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ていうか疲れが溜まってるのかなぁ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「夏休みだっていうのに君はけっこう頻繁にドタバタに巻きこまれてるっぽいしね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「無人島に漂流したりとかさ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「べつにいいけど。早く起きてよ～、明日の予定を決めちゃいたいんだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ほら、一緒に夏祭りに行くじゃない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「いやべつに、ノープランでもいいんだけどさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「昔はよく一緒に行ったし、でも当時に比べてお互い成長したしね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「で、デート的な？　そういう感じもよいのではないかと思ったりとかっ、えへへ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「んもう。お母さんが何か変な勘違いしたのかなぁ、浴衣とか用意してくれちゃってさ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『しっかりキメてきなさいよ、なつみ！』とか言われちゃってさ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「んもう、困っちゃうよね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「君は、ど～せ何も準備してないんだろうし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「よかったら、君のぶんの浴衣とかさ、どっかのお店に選びにいこうよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まぁ男の子だし、そういうの興味ないかもだけど？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あれなら、わたしが浴衣をつくってあげる！　せっかくだし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「夏休みだから時間あるしねっ、どうどう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「お～い……。さすがにちょっと、わたしだけ盛りあがってる感じで寂しくなってきたよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「起きて～？　生きてるよね、君ってほんきで過労死とかしそうで心配！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ん？　あれっ、起きてたんだ。どしたの、体調よくないの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「頭から布団をかぶって、こっちを恐る恐る見て……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「んん～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「何か言いたくないことでもあるのかなぁ、わたしを怒らせるような秘密を隠しているのかなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「怒らないから、言ってみて？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「あっ、寝直すな！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「こら～っ、白状しなさい！　ぜったい怒んないから、何を聞いても仏のような心でゆるすから！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「布団からでてきなさいっ、ちっちゃい子か！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ほっほう……。明後日に、保健委員会の子とかと一緒に夏祭りに行く約束をしたんだぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「相変わらずモテモテだなぁ、そっかぁ？　そうなんだ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「んん？　怒ってないよ？　わたしが怒る理由、あるかなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ねぇ、何とか言ってよ？　お返事ぐらいしようよ～、モテモテくぅん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ちょっと君は自惚れすぎかなぁ、わたしたち単なる幼なじみだもんね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「彼氏彼女とかじゃないしっ、いやまぁそれでわたしとの約束をドタキャンしてたら怒るけどね！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「いいもん。その代わり、明日はわたしが君を独り占めね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-goth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「他の子を呼んだりしないでね、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「いちおう言っとかないと君はむやみに女の子を増やすからね謎の引力で！」"
  }
]